.page pidof 1 find the process ids of programs

# SYNOPSIS
*pidof* _NAME_...

# DESCRIPTION
`pidof` prints, on one line, the ids of all processes whose name is exactly one of the _NAME_s.

# EXIT STATUS
0 if some process was found, 1 if none was.

# EXAMPLES
    pidof gapsh
    kill $(pidof sleep)

# SEE ALSO
ps(1), pkill(1), kill(1)
